From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Knowable Labs <knowl@knowl.invalid>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:37:41 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] webapp, server: take the controls that break a Knowl
 workspace from members

A workspace is one team whose Topics and members the research service manages.
A permissions migration takes renaming, archiving and re-describing a Topic,
changing its members, group messages and making a team from members; the webapp
hides what a role does not grant. The webapp also withholds editing and deleting
one's own sent message (agents revise their own posts, so the permission stays),
leaving and joining teams, group selection in the direct-message dialog, and
every language but English, the one in which Topic is written.

docs/guides/agent-workspace-design.md, Workspace controls.
